    <figcaption>Share of home pages with detected WCAG 2 failures. Source: WebAIM Million, 2026 report.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <h3>The average page has more errors than last year</h3>
  <figure>
    <img src="/images/research/errors-per-page-2026.svg" width="800" height="282" loading="lazy" alt="Bar chart: an average of 51 detected errors per home page in 2025 and 56.1 in 2026, an increase of 10.1 percent.">
    <figcaption>Average detected errors per home page. Source: WebAIM Million, 2026 report.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <details>
    <summary>View the headline data as a table</summary>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Measure</th><th scope="col">2025</th><th scope="col">2026</th></tr></thead>
